    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for valuable loot as <i>Zombiehood</i> puts your survival instincts to the test. Master a constantly shifting arsenal of weapons, gear, artifacts, and limited ammo while fending off relentless waves of increasingly powerful undead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Zombiehood</i> is deceptively deep. Enemies have weak points, armor, and resistances, pushing you to adapt your tactics with different weapon types and gear for maximum effect. Locational damage plays a key role\u2014shooting off a leg slows enemies to a crawl, giving you breathing room. Yet taking off a head doesn't always stop them. Movement feels tight and responsive, with agile dodges that keep you light on your feet. A varied arsenal keeps every fight fresh and unpredictable.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.poster.avif?t=1755028119\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.webm?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e7d66e855de1ea855ea6bfbe7a12c00a.mp4?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMERGENT ROGUELITE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zombiehood</i>\u2019s systems build dynamically on one another. As you gather weapons and upgrade your stats, you\u2019ll uncover powerful artifacts that shape your playstyle. Some provide stacking modifiers, while others offer unique effects. Discover synergies between your weapons, gear, and artifacts, and combine them wisely to create devastating builds that tear through enemies and barriers. Death isn\u2019t the end. Each run resets the world, but your progress carries over through earned skill points, currency, and blueprints, allowing you to grow stronger with every attempt.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.poster.avif?t=1755028119\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.webm?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/8fc6e9de08ae13f84e5b0e41948b1769.mp4?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAP VARIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps consist of diverse biomes with distinct level pools that generate procedurally each run, making no two playthroughs alike. A fog of war shrouds the overworld, challenging you to explore and overcome obstacles before facing the final boss. Along the way, discover shops to restock, buy new weapons and gear, and heal, as well as encounter random events that can either aid or hinder your progress.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.poster.avif?t=1755028119\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.webm?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/e9d3ea131c9494228da190dd955a12fd.mp4?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Procedurally Generated Levels</i></strong><br> Every run offers a unique experience with shifting biomes, level pools, and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Arsenal &amp; Customization</strong><br>Discover and master a vast arsenal of weapons, artifacts, and equipment, unlocking countless unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent Roguelite Progression</strong><br>Earn skill points, blueprints, and currency to build your character stronger with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shops &amp; Random Events</strong><br>Restock supplies, buy new gear, and face unpredictable events that can help or challenge your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unyielding Zombie Hordes</strong><br>Use strategic thinking to survive against relentless waves of undead.</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.poster.avif?t=1755028119\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.webm?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003120/extras/724b30e19c54341b7d8f99bea530ef53.mp4?t=1755028119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
